  "turns": [
    {
      "jobId": "39c2721d-6adb-40b7-a28f-bff47010d35a",
      "question": "Among the 50 most liquid US stocks, which sessions from March 2 through March 12, 2026 had the widest intraday price ranges? For each, how did it trade from open to close, and how much of its volume came in the last 30 minutes?",
      "submittedAt": "2026-10-01T04:41:38.720157Z",
      "completedAt": "2026-10-01T04:42:16.627200Z",
      "status": "success",
      "report": {
        "markdown": "**Widest intraday ranges (top‑50 liquidity universe, 2026‑03‑02 → 2026‑03‑12)**\n\n| Rank | Asset | Session (date) | Intraday range* | Open‑to‑close return* | Volume in last 30 min* |\n|------|-------|----------------|----------------|----------------------|------------------------|\n| 1 | CRCL | 2026‑03‑02 | **20.42 %** | **+19.06 %** | **16.18 %** |\n| 2 | CRCL | 2026‑03‑03 | **14.45 %** | **+8.78 %** | **12.57 %** |\n| 3 | BMNR | 2026‑03‑02 | **12.43 %** | **+7.78 %** | **17.37 %** |\n| 4 | CRCL | 2026‑03‑11 | **10.45 %** | **‑5.81 %** | **16.82 %** |\n| 5 | INTC | 2026‑03‑09 | **9.89 %** | **+6.55 %** | **26.12 %** |\n| 6 | APP  | 2026‑03‑04 | **9.44 %** | **+8.76 %** | **19.04 %** |\n| 7 | APP  | 2026‑03‑03 | **9.37 %** | **+6.64 %** | **13.73 %** |\n| 8 | APP  | 2026‑03‑10 | **9.30 %** | **‑7.14 %** | **17.14 %** |\n| 9 | MU   | 2026‑03‑09 | **9.04 %** | **+6.89 %** | **18.82 %** |\n|10 | COIN | 2026‑03‑04 | **8.53 %** | **+6.59 %** | **15.95 %** |\n\n\\*All figures are fractions from the minute‑bar scan, shown as percentages for readability.\n- **Intraday range** = (high − low) / open.\n- **Open‑to‑close return** = (close − open) / open.\n- **Volume in last 30 min** = `closing_volume_share` (share of the session’s total volume traded in the final 30 minutes).\n\n**Source:** Intraday scan of the 50 most‑liquid US stocks, ranked by `intraday_range` (highest) for the window 2026‑03‑02 → 2026‑03‑12.\n[1]\n\n**Limitations** – The scan returns the top 10 sessions only (the tool’s `limit` = 10). If more sessions are needed, the limit can be increased.\n\n## Sources\n\n- [1] Market analytics result — intraday scan — evidence `hermes-receipt:52bdf08776bb0847e4a693f3e32588782fc07055b686b099d07c44b077077efd`",
